# ============================================
# Living Network: Self-Pruning Neural Network
# ============================================
# Demonstrates soft-gating with gradient descent
# Each layer has an alpha gate that can learn to be 0 (pruned)

"Creating 3-gate Living Network..." println
"" println

# Input: ones(5) - will flow through gates
1 1 1 1 1 5 list tensor-from-list requires-grad

# Gate 1: alpha1 = 1.0
1.0 tensor-scale

# Gate 2: alpha2 = 1.0
1.0 tensor-scale

# Gate 3: alpha3 = 1.0  
1.0 tensor-scale

# Sum for loss
tensor-sum
"loss: " print dup to-text println

# Backward
backward
"" println

# Show all gradients
"Gradients (tensor-id -> gradient):" println
to-text println

"" println
"Analysis:" println
"  Input (id 1): grad = [1,1,1,1,1] (through all gates)" println
"  Each scale preserves gradients to input" println
"  With L1 penalty on alphas, network would prune gates!" println
